# Tools for the tests and checks; compile requirements-dev.txt with
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe requirements-dev.in
# pytest needs colorama on Windows only, so a compile on Linux leaves it out, and pip
# stops in a fresh venv on Windows, whose set-up AGENTS.md describes, at the unpinned
# colorama>=0.4: pinned here, it is in the lock file on every system.
colorama
coverage
graphql-core
hypothesis
# Markdown with the extensions of the website, for the tests of its hooks.
markdown
markdown-it-py
mypy
pymdown-extensions
pytest
pyyaml
ruff
types-pyyaml
